---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import SectionLink from '../components/SectionLink.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Product | Restless"
  description="What Restless does for an owner, what the company returns, and where the product boundary sits today."
>
  <PageIntro
    title="Less operating. More ownership."
    statement="Restless is for an owner who wants to set direction, make consequential judgments and receive finished work without becoming the task manager for a collection of agents."
    tone="wash"
  >
    <a class="text-action" href="/how-it-works/">Follow an outcome through the company</a>
  </PageIntro>

  <section class="exchange-section" aria-labelledby="exchange-heading">
    <div class="wide-heading">
      <h2 id="exchange-heading">A different contract with software.</h2>
      <p>The interface begins with a business outcome and ends with a prepared judgment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="exchange-grid">
      <div class="exchange-side">
        <h3>You provide</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Direction</strong><span>The outcome, constraints and why it matters.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Authority</strong><span>Budgets, permissions and exact approval boundaries.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Judgment</strong><span>Taste, strategic choice and the final consequential call.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="exchange-side exchange-side--return">
        <h3>Restless returns</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Native work</strong><span>A live product, document, campaign, dataset or resolved queue.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Evidence</strong><span>The checks, receipts and exact unknowns needed to trust the result.</span></li>
          <li><strong>A prepared last mile</strong><span>The right surface, exact decision and observable way to resume.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-spectrum" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
    <div class="wide-heading">
      <h2 id="work-heading">The work belongs in the business.</h2>
      <p>
        Restless is designed for the economically useful work owners normally keep in house. Each
        domain has a different shape, so the company chooses its organisation from the outcome.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="spectrum-rows">
      <div class="spectrum-row"><strong>Product</strong><p>Research, design, engineering, release preparation and operation around one coherent product result.</p><span>Coupled outcome</span></div>
      <div class="spectrum-row"><strong>Sales</strong><p>Territory research, account ownership, outreach preparation and follow-up across independent prospects.</p><span>Elastic queue</span></div>
      <div class="spectrum-row"><strong>Marketing</strong><p>Positioning, campaigns, content, distribution, measurement and adaptation around a defined commercial result.</p><span>Mixed work</span></div>
      <div class="spectrum-row"><strong>Research</strong><p>Independent evidence gathering followed by one decision-focused synthesis when the outcome requires it.</p><span>Parallel evidence</span></div>
      <div class="spectrum-row"><strong>Support</strong><p>Case ownership at volume, with a lead calibrating policy and handling the exceptions that change the queue.</p><span>Elastic queue</span></div>
      <div class="spectrum-row"><strong>Operations</strong><p>Incoming signals, recurring processes, exceptions and cross-functional follow-through inside the company computer.</p><span>Continuous loop</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="boundary-section" aria-labelledby="boundary-heading">
    <div class="boundary-copy">
      <h2 id="boundary-heading">Power where work is reversible. Control where consequences are real.</h2>
      <p>
        Research, drafts, code and internal analysis should move freely. Spending, publication,
        external representation and authority expansion cross a small deterministic boundary.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="boundary-line" role="img" aria-label="Internal work remains flexible while consequential external effects cross an authority boundary">
      <span>Flexible company work</span>
      <span class="boundary-gate">Authority</span>
      <span>Real-world effect</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="product-reality" aria-labelledby="reality-heading">
    <h2 id="reality-heading">What exists now</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        Restless is a control plane under active dogfood. The repository includes its company
        runtime, authority path, organisational state and owner surface. The next test is whether the
        whole system can improve Restless through a real release without founder rescue.
      </p>
      <a class="primary-action" href="/research/">Inspect the evidence <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="next-route" aria-label="Continue exploring Restless">
    <SectionLink index="Next" href="/how-it-works/" title="See how it works" description="Follow responsibility, production and review from mandate to native outcome." />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
